{"name":"Light Marshmallow Magic","hex":"#f4dddb","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"light","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Electromagnetic radiation in the wavelength range visible to the human eye (about 400–750 nanometers): visible light.","Electromagnetic radiation in the wavelength range visible to the human eye or in nearby ranges (infrared or ultraviolet radiation)."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To start (a fire).","To set fire to; to set burning."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/light"},{"term":"marshmallow","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Marsh mallow, a species of mallow, Althaea officinalis, that grows in marshy terrain. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A type of confectionery, originally (since Ancient Egyptian times) made from this plant, but now generally made of sugar or corn syrup, gelatin that has been presoftened in water, gum arabic, flavorings, and sometimes beaten egg whites, all whipped to a spongy consistency."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To soften (literally or figuratively)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/marshmallow"},{"term":"magic","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The application of rituals or actions, especially those based on occult knowledge, to subdue or manipulate natural or supernatural beings and forces in order to have some benefit from them. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The supernatural forces which are drawn on in such a ritual."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having supernatural talents, properties or qualities attributed to magic.","Producing extraordinary results, as though through the use of magic."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/magic"}],"entries":[{"title":"Marshmallow","blocks":[{"text":"Marshmallow is a confection made from sugar, water and gelatin whipped to a solid-but-soft consistency. It is used as a filling in baking or molded into shapes and coated with corn starch. This sugar confection is inspired by a medicinal confection made from Althaea officinalis, the marsh-mallow plant."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/White_Marshmallows.jpg/330px-White_Marshmallows.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marshmallow","wikidata":"Q272198"},{"title":"Light","blocks":[{"text":"Light, visible light, or visible radiation is electromagnetic radiation that can be perceived by the human eye. Visible light spans the visible spectrum and is usually defined as having wavelengths in the range of 400–700 nanometers (nm), corresponding to frequencies of 750–420 terahertz. The visible band sits adjacent to the infrared and the ultraviolet, called collectively optical radiation."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Prism_flat_rainbow_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Prism_flat_rainbow_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Light","wikidata":"Q9128"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Althaea_officinalis_002.JPG/500px-Althaea_officinalis_002.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Althaea_officinalis_002.JPG/1280px-Althaea_officinalis_002.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Althaea_officinalis_002.JPG/500px-Althaea_officinalis_002.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The marsh-mallow plant (Althaea officinalis)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAlthaea_officinalis_002.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Just_Born_Peeps_in_an_Easter_Basket.jpg/500px-Just_Born_Peeps_in_an_Easter_Basket.jpg?u